    "detailed_description": "Is life full of infinite pressure and helplessness, but nowhere to vent<br />\r\nIs reality filled with countless injustices and grievances, yet nowhere to confide in<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCome to this virtual world and release yourself!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a destruction simulator where you can freely destroy items, release stress, and make judgments about unfair things in the game<br />\r\nDo whatever you want, release your suppressed inner self<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a small simulation game with a total duration of about 1 hour<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGameplay:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlayers can freely destroy various items in the town, including furniture, cars, public facilities, etc., to release stress and emotions.<br />\r\nAt the same time, players can also choose to help small town residents solve their problems, such as judging unfair events, rescuing the little sister, and resolving conflicts with neighbors.<br />\r\nBy helping the residents in the town, players can unlock more special items.<br />\r\nThere are also some hidden tasks and bizarre events in the game that encourage players to explore and discover.",
